## Session Context (MiDashengLM-Gen Audio)

You have access to unified audio scene generation: speech, music, SFX, and
ambience in one 16 kHz mix, generated locally by the MiDashengLM-Gen model.

**Before starting work:**
1. Check model state: `audio_scene(operation="status")`
2. Browse the library: `audio_scene(operation="list", limit=5)`

**At end of work:**
- Use `audio_scene(operation="export", scene_id=..., destination=...)` when
  the user needs a WAV outside the library
- Offer `download_model` when status reports model_missing
